// A gently turning queued move (formations, formation_follow): 20 doughboys (Continental seed 101) sent 20 tiles east to
// 56,44, then with shift on to 76,54 (a turn of about 27 degrees) - under 90 degrees the formation goes on as it marches,
// swinging through the corner, instead of breaking up at the waypoint and forming anew (march_queued.eeai: 90 degrees)
wait_until(0.1min)
spawn(1, unit.inf10_doughboy, 35, 44, 20)
wait_until(0.4min)
cmd("fmove go 1 36 44 8 56 44 0 0")
wait_until(0.45min)
cmd("fmove then 1 76 54")
every(2s, 0.45min, 1.9min, (run) => {
    cmd("fmove stat")
})
wait_until(1.95min)
cmd("fmove sum")
